2026-07-27T09:29:11.5742205Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T09:29:11.5743174Z i /tmp/RtmpvkCpUs/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:29:11.5743853Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:29:11.5744354Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:29:11.5744798Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:29:11.5745478Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:29:11.5746497Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:29:11.5747432Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T09:29:11.5984489Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T09:29:11.6155186Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T09:29:11.6573810Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T09:29:11.6718824Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
